1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:09,260
You observe and follow teacher reading lesson.

2
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:16,550
Laughter Is Good Medicine

3
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:23,330
Laughter is good medicine.

4
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:39,080
Because when laughing, human breathing speed reaches 100 km/hour,

5
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:48,000
facial muscles are relaxed comfortably

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:00,110
and brain secretes a substance making people feel happy, satisfied.

7
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:11,600
Conversely, when people are angry or resentful,

8
00:01:11,970 --> 00:01:21,730
body secretes a substance constricting blood vessels.

9
00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:34,970
In some countries, people use laughter to treat patients.

10
00:01:34,970 --> 00:01:43,930
Purpose of this is to shorten treatment time

11
00:01:43,930 --> 00:01:49,910
Purpose of this is to shorten treatment time and save money for State.

12
00:01:49,910 --> 00:02:01,400
Thus, can say: whoever has humor, that person surely lives longer.

